{"page":403,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:53","surah":29,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ بِٱلْعَذَابِ ۚ وَلَوْلَآ أَجَلٌ مُّسَمًّى لَّجَآءَهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ وَلَيَأْتِيَنَّهُم بَغْتَةً وَهُمْ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They challenge you to hasten the punishment: they would already have received a punishment if God had not set a time for it, and indeed it will come to them suddenly and catch them unawares.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ","en_gloss":"And they ask you to hasten","transliteration":"wayastaʿjilūnaka","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[with] the punishment","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَوْلَآ","en_gloss":"And if not","transliteration":"walawlā","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَجَلٌۭ","en_gloss":"(for) a term","transliteration":"ajalun","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى","en_gloss":"appointed","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّجَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"surely (would) have come to them","transliteration":"lajāahumu","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَيَأْتِيَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"But it will surely come to them","transliteration":"walayatiyannahum","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَغْتَةًۭ","en_gloss":"suddenly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَشْعُرُونَ","en_gloss":"perceive","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","verse_key":"29:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:53"}]},{"verse_key":"29:54","surah":29,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"يَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ بِٱلْعَذَابِ وَإِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ لَمُحِيطَةٌۢ بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They challenge you to hasten the punishment: Hell will encompass all those who deny the truth,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ","en_gloss":"They ask you to hasten","transliteration":"yastaʿjilūnaka","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَمُحِيطَةٌۢ","en_gloss":"will surely, encompass","transliteration":"lamuḥīṭatun","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"bil-kāfirīna","verse_key":"29:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:54"}]},{"verse_key":"29:55","surah":29,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ يَغْشَىٰهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ مِن فَوْقِهِمْ وَمِن تَحْتِ أَرْجُلِهِمْ وَيَقُولُ ذُوقُوا۟ مَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"on the Day when punishment overwhelms them from above and from below their very feet, and they will be told, ‘Now taste the punishment for what you used to do.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"On (the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَغْشَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"will cover them","transliteration":"yaghshāhumu","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَوْقِهِمْ","en_gloss":"above them","transliteration":"fawqihim","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَحْتِ","en_gloss":"below","transliteration":"taḥti","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَرْجُلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their feet","transliteration":"arjulihim","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and He will say","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Taste","transliteration":"dhūqū","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"29:55"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٥٥","en_gloss":"(55)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:55"}]},{"verse_key":"29:56","surah":29,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰعِبَادِىَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِنَّ أَرْضِى وَٰسِعَةٌ فَإِيَّـٰىَ فَٱعْبُدُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My believing servants! My earth is vast, so worship Me and Me alone.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰعِبَادِىَ","en_gloss":"O My servants","transliteration":"yāʿibādiya","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَرْضِى","en_gloss":"My earth","transliteration":"arḍī","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٰسِعَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) spacious","transliteration":"wāsiʿatun","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِيَّـٰىَ","en_gloss":"so only","transliteration":"fa-iyyāya","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱعْبُدُونِ","en_gloss":"worship Me","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'budūni","verse_key":"29:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:56"}]},{"verse_key":"29:57","surah":29,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ذَآئِقَةُ ٱلْمَوْتِ ۖ ثُمَّ إِلَيْنَا تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Every soul will taste death, then it is to Us that you will be returned.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"Every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ذَآئِقَةُ","en_gloss":"(will) taste","transliteration":"dhāiqatu","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the death","transliteration":"l-mawti","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to Us","transliteration":"ilaynā","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُرْجَعُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be returned","transliteration":"tur'jaʿūna","verse_key":"29:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:57"}]},{"verse_key":"29:58","surah":29,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَنُبَوِّئَنَّهُم مِّنَ ٱلْجَنَّةِ غُرَفًا تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ نِعْمَ أَجْرُ ٱلْعَـٰمِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We shall lodge those who believed and did good deeds in lofty dwellings, in the Garden graced with flowing streams, there to remain. How excellent is the reward of those who labour,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَنُبَوِّئَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"surely We will give them a place","transliteration":"lanubawwi-annahum","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غُرَفًۭا","en_gloss":"lofty dwellings","transliteration":"ghurafan","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flow","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath it","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"will abide forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نِعْمَ","en_gloss":"Excellent is","transliteration":"niʿ'ma","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَجْرُ","en_gloss":"(the) reward","transliteration":"ajru","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰمِلِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the workers","transliteration":"l-ʿāmilīna","verse_key":"29:58"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:58"}]},{"verse_key":"29:59","surah":29,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ صَبَرُوا۟ وَعَلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ يَتَوَكَّلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who are steadfast, those who put their trust in their Lord!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"29:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"(are) patient","transliteration":"ṣabarū","verse_key":"29:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"and upon","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"29:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"29:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَتَوَكَّلُونَ","en_gloss":"put their trust","transliteration":"yatawakkalūna","verse_key":"29:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:59"}]},{"verse_key":"29:60","surah":29,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن مِّن دَآبَّةٍ لَّا تَحْمِلُ رِزْقَهَا ٱللَّهُ يَرْزُقُهَا وَإِيَّاكُمْ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How many are the creatures who do not store their sustenance! God sustains them and you: He alone is the All Hearing, the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَأَيِّن","en_gloss":"And how many","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a creature","transliteration":"dābbatin","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَحْمِلُ","en_gloss":"carry","transliteration":"taḥmilu","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رِزْقَهَا","en_gloss":"its provision","transliteration":"riz'qahā","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَرْزُقُهَا","en_gloss":"provides (for) it","transliteration":"yarzuquhā","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِيَّاكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and (for) you","transliteration":"wa-iyyākum","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Hearer","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"29:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:60"}]},{"verse_key":"29:61","surah":29,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ ٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُنَّ ٱللَّهُ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you ask the disbelievers who created the heavens and earth and who harnessed the sun and moon, they are sure to say, ‘God.’ Then why do they turn away from Him?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"29:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَأَلْتَهُم","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"sa-altahum","verse_key":"29:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّنْ","e